    "description": {
      "value": "<p data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1858\"><em data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1858\">(6th Level)</em></p><p data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1893\">You bind behavior to story roles.</p><p data-start=\"1895\" data-end=\"1915\">Choose an archetype:</p><ul data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"2009\"><li data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"1933\"><p data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"1933\">The Betrayer</p></li><li data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1948\"><p data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1948\">The Tyrant</p></li><li data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"1963\"><p data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"1963\">The Martyr</p></li><li data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"1976\"><p data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"1976\">The Fool</p></li><li data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"1993\"><p data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"1993\">The Guardian</p></li><li data-start=\"1994\" data-end=\"2009\"><p data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2009\">The Tempter</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2043\">The target must <em data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2042\">play the role</em>:</p><ul data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2124\"><li data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2055\"><p data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2055\">Hesitate</p></li><li data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2067\"><p data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2067\">Monologue</p></li><li data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2077\"><p data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2077\">Retreat</p></li><li data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2087\"><p data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2087\">Confess</p></li><li data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2099\"><p data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2099\">Overreach</p></li><li data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2124\"><p data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2124\">Submit to a constraint</p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2134\">Cost</h3><p data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2175\">Generates misfire risk if forced aggressively.</p><h3 data-start=\"2177\" data-end=\"2194\">Clarification</h3><p data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2277\">This does not override free will.<br />It constrains choices within archetypal gravity.</p><p data-start=\"2279\" data-end=\"2338\">The more resistant the target, the greater the misfire risk risk.</p><p><em>Recosted 2026-08-23: this ability's earlier economy (Civic Charge / Strain / Resonance / Leverage / Administrative Pressure) is retired \u2014 everything now runs on Surge, Clarity, Noise, and the misfire ladder. The ability dialog's cost line is the truth; ledgers named here are narrative, GM-adjudicated, never a tracked pool.</em></p>",
